==Notes==
*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*Unlike other spells, [[empower spell|empower]]ing ''quillfire'' increases only the die roll by 50%, not the die roll plus the bonus.
*The fortitude save to avoid the poison is always 18, the DC for large scorpion venom. Spell focus and ability modifiers have no effect on the DC.

